### ADS Dental Surgeries Appointments REST API

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/adsweb/api/v1

### 0. Authenticate as ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Extract token (if using VS Code REST Client)
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 0. Authenticate as JOHN (User)
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "password": "john123"
}

### 1. [ADMIN/USER] GET All Patients (Sorted by lastName ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. [ADMIN/USER] GET Patient by ID (Valid ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. [ADMIN/USER] GET Patient by ID (Invalid ID - Exception Handling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. [ADMIN] POST Register New Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Diana",
  "lastName": "Prince",
  "contactPhone": "555-5555",
  "email": "diana.p@amazon.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1988-06-15",
  "outstandingBillBalance": 0.00,
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Wonder Way",
    "city": "Themyscira",
    "state": "Paradise Island",
    "zipCode": "00000"
  }
}

### 5. [ADMIN] PUT Update Patient (Singular URI)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patient/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Williams-Smith",
  "contactPhone": "555-8888",
  "email": "alice.smith@email.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-14",
  "outstandingBillBalance": 50.00,
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Elm St",
    "city": "Austin",
    "state": "TX",
    "zipCode": "78701"
  }
}

### 6. [ADMIN] DELETE Patient (Singular URI)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patient/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. [ADMIN/USER] GET Search Patients (Singular URI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patient/search/Bob
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. [ADMIN/USER] GET All Addresses (Sorted by city ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
